CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'acb->adapter_type == ACB_ADAPTER_TYPE_A'
#96: FILE: drivers/scsi/arcmsr/arcmsr_hba.c:935:
+		if (((acb->adapter_type == ACB_ADAPTER_TYPE_A) && !dma_mask_64) ||
+		    dma_set_mask(&pcidev->dev, DMA_BIT_MASK(64)))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

